# Roll forward, jump, orbit the camera, pause and resume, then restart the stage.
10 capture /tmp/claude-1000/monkey_start.png
20 press w
200 tap space
300 press e
380 release e
420 release w
430 capture /tmp/claude-1000/monkey_mid.png
440 tap escape
450 capture /tmp/claude-1000/monkey_pause.png
460 tap escape
470 tap r
480 capture /tmp/claude-1000/monkey_restart.png
481 quit
